      <div class="w-10 h-10 flex-shrink-0 rounded-xl bg-brand-amber/10 flex items-center justify-center text-xl" aria-hidden="true">🍪</div>
      <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
        <h3 id="cookie-banner-title" class="font-bold text-navy text-sm">Wij gebruiken cookies</h3>
        <p id="cookie-banner-desc" class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          We gebruiken functionele en analytische cookies om uw ervaring te verbeteren.
          Lees meer in onze <a href="/cookies/" class="underline hover:text-navy">cookieverklaring</a>.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <button id="cookie-accept" class="btn-primary text-xs px-4 py-2">Alles accepteren</button>
          <button id="cookie-necessary" class="btn-outline text-xs px-4 py-2">Alleen noodzakelijk</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .footer-link {
